---
// Site-wide "work in progress" banner.
//
// Starlight's Page.astro renders <Banner /> unconditionally; its default
// component only shows when a page sets `banner` frontmatter. We override it so
// the notice appears on every page. Solid deep-violet background with white
// text keeps the contrast accessible (a full spectrum gradient would fail it).
---

<div class="k-wip-banner" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <svg
    class="k-wip-icon"
    aria-hidden="true"
    width="16"
    height="16"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="2"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
  >
    <path
      d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"
    ></path>
  </svg><strong>Work in progress.</strong> This documentation is actively being
  written and tracks an evolving project, so some pages will change.
</div>

<style>
  .k-wip-banner {
    padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    line-height: var(--sl-line-height-headings);
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9, #9333ea);
    box-shadow: var(--sl-shadow-sm);
  }
  .k-wip-icon {
    vertical-align: -3px;
    margin-inline-end: 0.45em;
  }
</style>
